stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CLOSED
    CLOSED --> LISTEN: passive open (listen)
    CLOSED --> SYN_SENT: active open (connect)
    LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD: nhận SYN
    SYN_SENT --> SYN_RCVD: nhận SYN+ACK (simul-open)
    SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED: nhận SYN+ACK, gửi ACK
    SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED: nhận ACK cuối
    ESTABLISHED --> [*]: close()<br/>SYN/FIN 4-way riêng